# Standby (power service, foundation §7): read a page, put the device down
# (active -> idle after 5 s: idle clock), lock it with the power key and
# unlock it again at once (while the chip is entering sleep), lock it, leave it
# locked for 5 minutes (light sleep in 60 s slices; a touch and a cover key
# while it sleeps must not reach the app), wake it with the power key and turn
# a page, then leave it untouched until it locks by itself (10 min) and wake it
# with the AI key. Pessimistic Plus profile, LTE.
@3s      tap   80% 56%        # 阅读 (favourite)
+2500ms  tap   50% 160dp          # 星星邮差
+3s      key   next               # page turn 1
+20s     snap  idle-page          # idle since 5 s after the turn
+1s      key   power              # lock (short press) ...
+1420ms  key   power              # ... and unlock at once: lands in the chip's sleep entry sequence
+2s      snap  quick-unlock       # unlocked, not asleep for a slice
+1s      key   power              # lock again
+3s      snap  locked             # page + lock mark
+60s     tap   50% 50%            # asleep: touch is not a wake source
+30s     key   next               # asleep: cover key (touch controller) too
+200s    key   power              # wake: the mark comes off
+2s      snap  unlocked
+2s      key   next               # page turn 2: works at once
+11m     snap  auto-locked        # no input for 10 min: locked by itself
+60s     key   ai                 # the AI key wakes it too
+3s      snap  unlocked-ai
+1s      end
